     [38;5;246mPOST batched JSON to a configurable URL with an optional auth header. Works with Better Stack, Datadog HTTP intake,
[39m     [38;5;246mLoki, or self-hosted. Switching destinations is a config change, not a rewrite.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Sentry via CDN import
     [38;5;246mReal error tracking with stack traces and grouping, at the cost of third-party JavaScript on the login page, a [39m
     [38;5;246mseparate Node SDK, and coding against a vendor API.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Build the seam, pick later
     [38;5;246mSame as option 1 but the URL starts unset: console logging works immediately, shipping switches on when you fill in
